{"server":"cn","storyId":"act4d0_level_act4d0_st05","groupId":"act4d0","stageId":null,"title":"课后作业","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st05.txt","sourceHash":"16d54c374f6bf7dbc9b22ffc69065133e0e0433181838476192d48c15150950f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"伊芙利特与红在作业问题上产生争执，伊芙利特情绪再度失控，险些暴走。\n但她最终还是在周围的帮助下，努力控制住了自己。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"一切都是白色的。\n头顶的天空与脚下的地面，目所能及之处，全都被安静的白色填满。\n纯白、寂静、空无一物。\n只有火苗摇曳燃烧。\n从某一个时间点起，悄然侵蚀梦境，又于梦醒时融化消弭。\n“这里是哪里？”\n无人应答。\n“我为什么会在这里？”\n无人应答。\n“我该怎么离开？”\n无人应答。\n“......”\n除了自己之外，谁都不在。\n除了自己之外，什么都没有。\n那么，\n所有的困惑就只剩下一个——\n“你......是什么？”\n......\n............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"02:35 P.M.  天气/阴转小雨\n罗德岛舰船，二号舱室，干员生活区"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（又来了。怎么老做那个梦，那到底什么玩意啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃，头都睡扁了，好痛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（抓头）烦死了，都是博士那家伙害的，这些题也太难写了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"这什么怪题目啊，还要求面积？搞什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"停停停停。不是现在，别烧起来啊喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"还是把桌角烤焦了......算了，还好作业没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"博士那家伙......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"喂， 这些一定要都写完吗？真麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？学起来对我有好处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"废话，这我当然知道，要不然谁要跟你学！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"但是作业也太多了吧！而且这个词和这个词有什么区别啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为我讲了你两句，赫默还拿走了我的辣椒干，这都怪你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你还笑？！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我知道她藏辣椒干的地方。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？！在哪？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"真要跟你一起拿了，你和我肯定都会挨骂。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"别一直笑啊，又不说话，很奇怪呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是压根就不想回答我啊？"}]},{"label":"炭烤沙虫腿，来一根？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"恶，博士，这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"拿走拿走，我不要！——唔唔唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼）呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（吞咽）咕嘟......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我吃了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，博士，赫默明天是不是要去出任务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"带上我一起，怎么样？我的实力，你知道的对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你去和她说说，让我也去看看吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这次行动是收尾，你更擅长战斗吧？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什么，你说的那些我也会啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么我们现在没得战斗，让我去啊，我一定要给其他人看看我的实力！"}]},{"label":"这个月投诉有点多，先忍忍吧？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我这能烧干整个战场的火力，他们就是做不到才嫉妒我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不管那些人怎么说呢！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默和你总该相信我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人不能理解，我没关系，又不关我的事，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"但为什么连你们也这么说！为什么呀！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"伊芙利特，冷静！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"烦死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，去他的。我看看，这题这题还有这题......都填C。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这题......看不太懂，算了随便写写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就成了......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到做检查的时间了，伊芙利特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"烦人的家伙来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么一股烧着了的味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特？打扰一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"今天要做一个血液源石结晶密度检查，请你配合......嗯？这桌子是怎么回事，怎么被烧焦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。就是个意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特......这样很危险的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛内部是不允许出现明火的，如果是你的话，更要好好控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟他们说了，不可以用抑制类的药物，但也需要你好好配合......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啰嗦死了。烦不烦啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊芙利特，我只是个普通的护士，我不太会带孩子，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的话，我们能好好交流......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"谁又是孩子了，你好烦啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我要摊上你这种人，就不能让我一个人呆着吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特......我也有自己的工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别管我的事！说过好多次了，那些穿着白大褂的，我看见就难受！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"快让开，别挡着我出门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，检查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我让你别挡路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我的作业！烧，烧起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你搞什么，搞什么啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特！快，快灭火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"都说了，让我一个人待着！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么赔我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，不行！我去叫夜莺小姐，请等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我又做了什么啊，可恶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，作业！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......破破烂烂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（赫默也不肯带上我。可恶，明明我那么强！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（现在博士也出去了，就只剩下那些讨人厌的白大褂......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（真烦，这么怕我的话干脆就离我远点啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（本子......稍稍烧焦了一点，不过还行吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了，总之先把练习题放到博士的办公桌上，应该就OK了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样行动，一般干员会被吓到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在走路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"一般干员是不会在墙面上走路的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上拿的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"是作业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦。但凯尔希说，这要听博士的。红没得选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这里你懂吗？这个词汇。红不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然会......居然会问我问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我试试好了，就先让我看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"这个词，嗯，也不是很难理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......大概就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"这样说，能懂吗？我怕我讲得不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你其实也可以直接问博士？博士的解答，肯定比我的更准确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"也可以。但红觉得和霜叶说话轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......这样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们堵在这干什么呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这不是小红帽吗？真神奇，你居然没直接出现在课堂上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"——伊芙利特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，别那么靠近她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"红她有很强的防范意识，会下意识地反应，别被伤到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"防范意识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"靠近你五厘米的东西会怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红切掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你这个冰块脸还挺了解她的嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"干员手册我是有好好请教杜宾老师的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不过红，对别的干员，可以稍微放轻松一些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"很好笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"红，她不是这个意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？你藏在背后的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？哦，是，是作业啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"本伊芙利特大人可是轻轻松松做完了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......嗯，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红闻到了烧焦的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，作业烧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是有意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是不是觉得我没完成作业，用火烧掉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"想说就说啊，别这样说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"别，伊芙利特，红是真的不太会说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你生气了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"烦死了，好讨厌啊。我为什么要和你一起上课啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎么搞的，真是烦透了......怎么这么不走运啊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，伊芙利特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到周围的温度在升高，这很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你懂什么啊？我好得很，别用那种好像什么都知道一样的语气和我说话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"威胁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"红，别会错意！她只是习惯了这么说话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你哪里明白了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。\n伤害别人的怪物。烧掉一切的怪物。克制不住自己的怪物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我，很痛，很痛啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你要着火了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，伊芙利特......不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"关你们什么事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你们又懂我哪些了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"快住手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她威胁我。不，她威胁到了罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不要动手，红！她只是一时发热！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"谁发热了？你是不是想说我头脑发热？我清醒得很！你那点冷气根本不顶用，快走开，你也想被烧成灰吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"不要。不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"控制不了自己。很弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"小红帽，你会被烤焦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。\n不，不可以，那些是朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"别！伊芙利特！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物！\n不！我不是！！\n火焰在燃烧。\n火焰在疯狂地燃烧。\n巨大的怪物咯咯直笑。\n白色的房间被烧的又黑又焦。\n有人在哭，有人在跑。\n哎呀，这是哪里呢？\n有人走了过来，好熟悉，好高......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"塞......救......大家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，哎呀哎呀，大家这是在做什么呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙芙？在走廊上点火可不行哦。塞雷娅知道了会生气的。当然，赫默也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"去......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是......你不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"水分子的集群，去让火焰安静下来吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"噗哈——这水也太冰了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......缪缪？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"缪缪，帮帮我......我不想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——可不要告诉其他人我来玩哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题！就交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，看到你还是这么有精神，我就放心啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，要好好遵守我们之间约定哦，伊芙芙？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"粗暴。\n肆意。\n横行。\n总是在破坏。\n......\n我自己其实也是知道的。\n会痛的实验让人讨厌。\n那些白大褂的目光让人讨厌。\n这 片 大 地 让 人 讨 厌。\n说什么人生。\n说什么未来。\n只要我放一把火，只要火烧得够旺，所有那些用讨厌眼神看着我的人，那些白色的墙壁和刺鼻的消毒水，所有所有，全都会消失在火中。\n只要我喜欢的人还在就好了。\n其他人怎么样关我什么事？\n——在来到这里之前，我一直是这么想的。\n我一直觉得自己是这么想的。\n但是现在不一样了。\n粗暴。\n哎我当然知道。\n肆意。\n行啦我会小心点的。\n横行。\n......也没那么严重吧？\n总是在破坏。\n我也不想的啊！\n我又不是不明白，很多事情谁想这样啊。\n但至少，哼......\n你们说的，我有照着去做。\n我可不能烧掉罗德岛和作业。\n还有朋友，哼......我的朋友也一定要像我一样了不起呀！\n所以，没事的。我努力的还不够。我还要更加努力！\n看好了，我绝对要让你们大吃一惊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一下子毁了一整条过道？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"才、才没有！烦死了，不要你管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......小红帽她们呢，没事吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你让小红帽躲开了？哼，算你识相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我有危险？大家都有危险？啊......"}]},{"label":"炭烤沙虫腿，来一根？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"给我也来一根......不、不对！才不要吃啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......吃不下去呀。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"那个、走廊的事、唔呃、我也不是有意要破坏的......总之，对、对不起啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，怎么会搞成这个样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，不是要检查作业吗？给你！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这本本子，看起来饱经火灼啊。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，嫌弃的话就别拿啊！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你能看出来这是什么，对吧。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"交给你了，这就是我的作业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"出了点小岔子，变成这样......喂，你那是什么表情，你有什么意见吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"总之就是这样！不管你信不信，反正我写完了，我真的写完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，顶、顶多就是撕坏了一点，被火烧了下，又被水浇了下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃呃，还有瞎写的题目多了点嘛，今后我会好好写啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我又搞砸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你要骂就骂吧。对不起。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"伊芙利特，把手伸出来。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？搞什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"喏。别打太狠哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是......干脆鬼椒？我最喜欢的辣椒干！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"欸、啊？是给我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"什么啊......搞什么啊！混蛋，我告诉你，可别以为区区这么点零食，就能、就能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"（大声吸鼻子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，算你上道！虽然我还是觉得你们这些穿白大褂的家伙有问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你就也勉强算是个例外吧！（小声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我可警告你！别总是和赫默一样拿我当小孩子看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的会生气的！生气起来超——可怕的！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是个很优秀的干员。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"呃、呃呃、突然说什么啊，这不是理所当然的吗！"}]},{"label":"很有气势啊，伊芙芙。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——咳、咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"谁告诉你这个称呼，不对，谁、谁允许你这样喊我的啊！"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"下一次行动，你也出动吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是下一次会让我也一起去咯？是这个意思吧？啊？你可别骗我啊！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但是......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"但是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"欸你快说啊，不要让我急啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"心平气和自己想？那是什么，我不懂你在说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，得去道歉啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"那个每天来看我的姐姐，我不是有意吓她的......我也不想对霜叶她们那么凶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，博士，帮我个忙吧，你帮我去跟她们说吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"为什么不自己去说呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你又吓唬医疗干员了？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"这次我肯定犯错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们真的很烦人！但我确实不该那么做的吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想你老因为这些事被别人说啊。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"下次我们去海边玩的话，你要不要去？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"海边？那是啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊无所谓，要去！我要去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不，为什么突然要带我去玩？博士你有点奇怪......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"因为你表现必须好一点，我才能说服赫默。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"切，什么嘛，还是想让我做这做那对吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自己去道歉吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，放心！包在我身上，不就是道个歉嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我们约好了对吧？你可不能反悔不带我去哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，海边！嗯，听起来就很有意思呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！明天见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是还在看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我心里清楚得很，那些人怎么看我，怎么想我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"但这有什么关系？我才不在乎，嘁，我才不要在乎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定会把你干掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"知道吗，就是你老害我丢脸，就是你老让麻烦事缠上我！"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有我，你是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你以为我还像以前一样怕你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"老让我那么痛，老让所有人都那么痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你这大胖子！傻瓜！肥胖火团！长角的热气球！"},{"type":"narration","text":"呼呼，有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"你看好了，以后我可不会再什么都烧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是知道的，有东西能烧，有东西是不能的！"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有不能被焚烧的事物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"什么呀，我不愿意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"本伊芙利特大人不愿意烧，那就是不能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"那些挡着我的路的，我肯定一把火给他们全烧干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些不能的，我是绝对不会动的！连一点火我都不会发出来！"},{"type":"narration","text":"那我等着，小东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"迟早有一天......一定！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","aliases":["伊芙利特"]},{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["红"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
